    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding cost-optimization strategies, our can propose to the client that the client consider using our more cost-efficient tiers or models, such as the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, which are mentioned in our budget envelope notes as being more cost-efficient on the recurring side. using could help reduce the annual operating costs and ensure compatibility with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
