    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our can work with the client to identify areas where our solution can help reduce the client administrative and documentation workload, potentially leading to indirect cost savings for the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By highlighting these benefits and proposing a cost-efficient approach, our can demonstrate our commitment to optimizing costs while delivering the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that assists hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, improves efficiency and quality of care, and provides explainable/traceable recommendations or suggestions. a solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improves efficiency and quality of care, and provides explainable/traceable recommendations or suggestions must also support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
