    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key AI-related challenges we should address in this project, and how can we ensure that we solution meets the key AI-related challenges we should address in this project? the key AI-related challenges we should address in this project include providing explainable and traceable recommendations or suggestions, supporting medical coding for activity reporting, and ensuring a solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improves efficiency and quality of care, and provides explainable/traceable recommendations or suggestions improves efficiency and quality of care." ;
