    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the key AI-related challenges we should address in this project, we will leverage we core approach to Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), where every answer is generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, and the answer cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This grounding behavior ensures that we suggestions are explainable and traceable. we capabilities in structured extraction, such as assisting with PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes, will support medical coding for activity reporting." ;
