    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we template-guided drafting capability can help generate high-quality clinical and administrative documents, including discharge summaries and medical reports." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve efficiency and quality of care, we will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the hospital staff's work environment, capable of supporting the hospital staff's in the hospital staff's clinical and administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the hospital staff's work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical and administrative activities will include surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications to assist with dossier handling. we solution will also ensure continuity of care by providing structured handover summaries that allow another professional to efficiently take over an in-progress dossier with full context.  we will work closely with the client to select and curate the appropriate corpus, tune we retrieval and generation models, and design effective prompts and templates to meet the client specific needs and requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, we can ensure that we solution meets the client's expectations for improving efficiency, quality of care, and providing explainable recommendations while supporting medical coding and continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

