    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium is pleased to submit a proposal for the implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff at Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). an AI assistance solution aims to improve the efficiency and quality of care delivered by Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) staff, while ensuring strict compliance with regulatory requirements. an AI assistance solution will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from hospital staff's work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff's in hospital staff's clinical-administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from hospital staff's work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities will facilitate access to reliable and up-to-date information drawn from Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation. an AI assistance solution will also assist with drafting medical and administrative documents, support in handling dossiers, and provide explanations for recommendations or suggestions." ;
