        ex:hasText "Our approach is based on Our Atelier platform, which utilizes retrieval-augmented generation to provide fast and accurate responses to common queries. our Atelier platform, which utilizes retrieval-augmented generation to provide fast and accurate responses to common queries has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common single-document queries have a p95 latency below 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

