        ex:hasText "Our will work closely with Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) to select and curate the appropriate corpus, tune Our retrieval and generation models, and design effective prompts and templates to meet Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) specific needs and requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

